#: data/com.aripd.Pano.metainfo.xml.in:69
msgid ""
"This release fixes many problems that Pano Terminal had from GNOME Terminal. "
"F10 opens the main menu, menus give the focus back to the terminal, and the "
"context menu opens from the keyboard and with a long press. Zooming and "
"switching tabs keep the window size, and the main menu shows the zoom level. "
"Closing asks about stopped jobs, built-in palettes keep your own colors, "
"conflicting shortcuts are reported, and links are recognized more reliably. "
"Programs of tabs that are not shown yet start right away."
msgstr ""

#: data/com.aripd.Pano.metainfo.xml.in:74
msgid ""
"Pano Terminal opens from the applications menu when it is built from source "
"and installed to a prefix such as ~/.local. The Turkish translation is "
"complete, and the other translations are up to date with the current strings."
msgstr ""

#: data/com.aripd.Pano.metainfo.xml.in:79
msgid "The first release of Pano Terminal, a fork of GNOME Terminal."
msgstr ""

